Lane m10-boss-onscreen (ACCEPTANCE A10) - Boss-Spawn hinter HP-Leiste/Banner behoben.
Boss-Frame (56/64/72/80/96/96 px) wird per composedBossCenterY unter max(hpBar.bottom, banner.bottom)+6 px komponiert; Ring-Winkel gespiegelt, X/HP/Tempo unveraendert.
Intro-Banner (Run.ts showBossBannerWhenVisible) erst nach Sichtbarkeits-Guard; Banner-Dauer 2400 ms unveraendert, AutoPlay/God unberuehrt.
Vorher (shots/m10-boss-onscreen-before.json): Banner-Overlap 39-1239 px2 (1,24-13,44 %), bannerGap -1..-21 px.
Nachher (shots/m10-boss-onscreen-after.json): 12/12 Faelle 0 px HP-Overlap, 0 px Banner-Overlap, boss.top-hpBottom min. 71 px.
Tests: tests/boss-spawn-composition.test.ts 13/13 gruen, npm test 314/314 (27 Dateien), npm run build rc=0.
